{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1000_null", "source_sha256": "44458a7b70eacf3be2fd16b267c795cf0aa7883997856d52092605a64e4c1218", "ja": "Team3rd、PV撮影の日……", "zh": "Team3rd，PV拍摄当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "d7fb174e01401878465caadd1dcf9c94f70abc886219455f117a87dab438b2f5", "ja": "おはようございます、765プロです！\n本日はよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "早上好，我是765号制作人！\n今天请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "b5628cc242a0bcd54b673a14e4cefd61a6ed92cadbf300aa8872d2156b27ea9b", "ja": "えっと……おはようございます！\n大神環です、よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "那个……早上好！\n我是大神环，今后请多关照——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1003_stafftati", "source_sha256": "d64a40cc2c18322b43bbf285cae51b3fd6dc5dd625cabde116ac13b16715fc4f", "ja": "おはようございまーす！", "zh": "早安──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "7862dd5d7b5e570510a02e2563042fc734d2cc245a0f3849ff907cc514af76f2", "ja": "他のメンバーの合流時間までもう少しあるから、\nそれまでは待機かな。", "zh": "距离其他成员集合还有一会儿，在那之前先待命吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "4173a7a9896bdbd365ee5f30ebac78d66d210f2f3c97684de526e8711e0113a9", "ja": "テントで椅子に座っててもいいし、\nあ、散歩でもするか？", "zh": "可以坐在帐篷里的椅子上等着，\n啊，要不要去散散步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "e96daf197006c129854e4a5bf4ea4afdeffa59dc9ccfb2267af67aa615bbb2a8", "ja": "……。\nねえねえ、おやぶん。", "zh": "……\n那个，老大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "96e9fe9d96903713396d14e69ffdd178a236e494931ef309fcd91a010509f285", "ja": "今は夕方でしょ？　なのに、みんなどうして\n「おはようございます」っていうの？", "zh": "现在是傍晚吧？可是，为什么大家都要说“早上好”呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "18cee3e03b567191260d8ef792dd74dcf376ae9568a75308dc40f5e172375702", "ja": "ああ、芸能界の挨拶が気になってたのか。\n理由は言ってなかったっけ。", "zh": "啊，原来你是在意演艺圈的问候方式啊。\n我之前没说过原因吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "79ca8883fca42281554dc837c45d3b02809eaaf1b647b580127acbf899923fc5", "ja": "俺も先輩に聞いたんだけど、なんでも、芸能界の人は\n起きる時間がバラバラだから、らしいぞ。", "zh": "我也问过前辈，好像是因为演艺圈的人起床时间都不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "61fc344ec745f69e62c628b8e948190eae16beeff876738b7e6b82795bef043b", "ja": "起きる時間……？\nねぼうしちゃう人もいるから、ってこと？", "zh": "起床时间……？\n是因为也有人会睡过头吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "390271257bfcbbecbf7926857302b90322253cee124e23a481cf6f5040108202", "ja": "ちょっと違うかな。えっと……、\n始まる時間が人それぞれ、ってこと。", "zh": "好像有点不对。那个……就是说，每个人开始一天的时间都不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "46a12459d187c8a2fe98310ebb06c955111532a0f7b8308120dc39d4b2815268", "ja": "朝だけじゃなくて、夕方とか夜から、\n一日が始まる人もいるってことらしい。", "zh": "不只是早上，听说也有人是从傍晚或者夜里开始新的一天的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "970d2808847a8264c3aed88af8a7dc07e5f87050c80345b6ea7b3ccaed8c0a21", "ja": "あ、そっか！\nじゃあ、たまきと同じだぞ！", "zh": "啊，这样啊！\n那就和环一样啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "d838f908b89a890c58331ebe503632c88ae59b16ea77c9bfcbe092da4d08cdda", "ja": "え、環も？", "zh": "诶，环也是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "6a64823bd69dec8a3a90dd9679121334f1086bea5ea0920bac5af31165f2e016", "ja": "うん！　たまきもばあちゃんちでね、\n夜に起きて夜しか出ない虫捕りに行ったり、", "zh": "嗯！环也会在奶奶家，晚上起床去抓只有夜里才会出现的虫子，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "915093d0ead5f37604f4d427b4b90011bca7ea56f67a1b49c6cd1f4b0441fdff", "ja": "ものすごい朝早く起きて、カブトムシ探して\n裏山のクヌギを見に行ったりしてたんだ～！", "zh": "起得特别特别早，为了找独角仙\n跑去后山的栎树林里看之类的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "6053b2df6a516a35aac19d995b8bd0048922eab73bd439f49b261d8df5dd7aaa", "ja": "はは、なるほど。\n……うん。確かに同じかもしれないな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n……嗯。确实可能是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "656663be04beae64a60e6933f00715363bbf24c39f77e7b6d06c5d1f8ee2501f", "ja": "必要な時に、必要なタイミングで、全力をつくす。\n……この世界は、そういうモノなんだと思う。", "zh": "在需要的时候，于恰当的时机竭尽全力。\n……我想，这个世界就是这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "2c41ad7557803d89dc107baca58137483e1bbeda9e4380f2b119e125dfd45818", "ja": "……じゃあ「おはようございます」は、\n「一緒にがんばろう！」なの？", "zh": "……那么，“早上好”就是\n“我们一起加油吧！”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "d143f80e9acf54fab79b593afab1b56a0a6ed6ea148d3c144046d18fd1809594", "ja": "！　……ああ、その通りだ。\n環はすごいな！", "zh": "！……啊，正是如此。环真厉害啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "4df9a08f65465f053d4928633ac5cca34901b1373c33b657dc89d307f9c265db", "ja": "え、たまきすごいの！？\nくふふ！　おやぶんにほめられたぞ～♪", "zh": "诶，小环很厉害吗！？\n嘿嘿！得到老大夸奖啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "2c42175d279d3ea76e453ce27ce14b1eab8992dd75eb5350c9ceb65fa04fd82a", "ja": "じゃあたまき、これから劇場のみんなにもいっぱい\n「おはようございます！」っていうね！", "zh": "那环，环接下来也要对剧场的大家多多说“早上好！”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "1c603016dc6fdd9a0ce51d29273b607445cf3358a3cff7ca829c565b2397f45d", "ja": "ああ、どんどん言ってくれ。\nみんなで元気よく、一緒に頑張っていこう！", "zh": "啊，尽管跟大家打招呼吧。\n让我们一起精神饱满地努力下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "4de4c7439ecc43e105ae6df078bfb53814c5f43c4d979ecc2ef8dc9c56898493", "ja": "お、噂をすれば……ほら。", "zh": "哦，说到谁谁就到……看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "c5c546b73f967dc27e74b203ec5ccdc49aa50dbf830c3b2668420233730e7c8d", "ja": "あ、みんな来た！\nたまき、むかえに行って挨拶してくる～！", "zh": "啊，大家都来了！\n环，去迎接大家，跟大家打个招呼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0413_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "97f94578ed4dcd740d3df974d464505c3735b5c076010d24850718a496c372a6", "ja": "ことはー！　ふうかー！　めぐみー！　ゆりこー！\nおはようございまーす！！", "zh": "琴叶——！风花——！惠美——！百合子——！\n早上好——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
